Package: microsip-linux
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libgtk-4-0, libayatana-appindicator3-1, libglib2.0-0
Description: MicroSIP port to Linux — Rust + GTK4 SIP softphone
 MicroSIP is a lightweight, reliable SIP softphone ported to Linux. Written in
 Rust with a GTK4 interface and system tray support, based on the PJSIP stack.
 Permite cuentas SIP, marcación, llamadas entrantes/salientes y minimización a
 la bandeja del sistema.
